# sweep: --bare paired
# A reader paired with a computer and with nothing on it yet. Books keeps
# the Articles shelf, so Sync is in reach, and the empty shelf says where
# articles come from. The computer is not running its helper, so Sync says
# that plainly instead of spinning.
wait-for Articles
expect No articles
expect-missing No books yet
clean
shot books-articles-home-empty
tap Articles
wait-for No articles yet
expect Sync
expect-missing Checking your computer
clean
shot books-articles-empty
tap Sync
wait-for Your computer is not answering
clean
shot books-articles-computer-away
